    "node_01097c20e1": {
      "id": "node_01097c20e1",
      "speaker": "prosecutor",
      "text": "Thank you, Your Honor. Ladies and gentlemen of the jury, the evidence\nwill show that the defendant, Mr. Griffy, deliberately attempted to murder Tracy Stakes on the evening of March 14th.",
      "options": [],
      "position": {
        "x": 2232,
        "y": -390
      },
      "nextNodeId": "node_c07b04dc70"
    },
    "node_c07b04dc70": {
      "id": "node_c07b04dc70",
      "speaker": "prosecutor",
      "text": "You will hear testimony from eyewitnesses who were present at the scene. You will also see CCTV footage showing the defendant following Ms. Stakes shortly before the attack.",
      "options": [],
      "position": {
        "x": 2615,
        "y": -351
      },
      "nextNodeId": "node_f84e3b895f"
    },
    "node_f84e3b895f": {
      "id": "node_f84e3b895f",
      "speaker": "prosecutor",
      "text": "The evidence will demonstrate that this was not an accident or a misunderstanding. The defendant had the opportunity, the means, and the intent to cause Ms. Stakes serious harm.\n",
      "options": [],
      "position": {
        "x": 2989,
        "y": -327
      },
      "nextNodeId": "node_a1c93e7b42"
    },
    "node_70d3a12d56": {
      "id": "node_70d3a12d56",
      "speaker": "defendant",
      "text": "Objection. On what grounds?\n",
      "options": [],
